Android's gSFXBank (0009bacc) adds upramp, a sample Windows lacks, at 42; the
port appends it to the PC bank (shell/extras.cpp). Android's cRSubGoldy::AI
(0007ac54) plays it on the raised and plain ramp tiles once the snail is more
than 1.0 past the z of the last ramp that played it, which +0x448 keeps and
nothing resets, and cRPathFollowGoldy::Traverse (0004d70c) plays it at the
SuperTramp launch, before the voice line.

